              <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#232F3E;">Founder &amp; Chairman, <a href="https://ionova.ai?utm_source=newsletter" style="color:#0972D3;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;">ioNova</a></p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#466587;">30+ years building payments STP &amp; sanctions-screening for tier-1 banks &middot; Writing on ISO 20022, address intelligence &amp; payments compliance in <em>Resolved</em>.</p>

